  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Application Architecture**\n\nI\'m now focusing on systematically building the application\'s architecture. The initial step involves defining all domain types in `src/types/index.ts`. This covers everything from CPE 2.3 and CISA KEV to EPSS, SLA tiers, feed types, deduplication, pipelines, findings, advisories, email logs, health checks, and security headers.\n\n\n**Building Core Components**\n\nI\'ve been concentrating on essential utilities. Specifically, I\'ve created the CPE 2.3 parser and matcher (`src/utils/cpeMatcher.ts`) to handle wildcards and component matching, including a fallback vendor/product heuristic. The deduplicator (`src/utils/deduplicator.ts`) is complete with CVE ID normalization and O(1) set lookup. I also implemented pre-seeded threat feeds and rich CVE data with CVSS/EPSS/KEV information.\n\n\n**Designing UI/UX Views**\n\nI\'m now deep in the UI design. I\'m fleshing out several key views: the pipeline execution tracker with live step updates, the dashboard showing KPIs and exposure, and a watchlist focused on CPE management. I\'m also working on a findings triage table with SLA indicators and remediation details. The threat data view is in progress, as is the advisories view, which will now also feature instant PDF export.\n\n\n**Constructing Feature Views**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the application\'s feature-specific views. I\'m implementing a JSON download for pipeline reports. Also, I\'m working on views for alerted CVE history, threat feeds with custom feed creators, recipients management with email validation, an advisory template editor, email history with retry mechanisms, operational logs, system health checks, and a settings view for scope hours and SLA configurations.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_69951"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false,\"CodeContent\":\"export type Severity = \'CRITICAL\' | \'HIGH\' | \'MEDIUM\' | \'LOW\';\\n\\nexport type ExposureLevel = \\n  | \'INTERNET_FACING\' \\n  | \'INTERNAL_CRITICAL\' \\n  | \'DMZ\' \\n  | \'WORKSTATION\' \\n  | \'CLOUD_INFRA\';\\n\\nexport type PriorityTier = \\n  | \'P0_CISA_KEV\' \\n  | \'P1_CRITICAL\' \\n  | \'P2_HIGH\' \\n  | \'P3_MEDIUM\' \\n  | \'P4_LOW\';\\n\\nexport type FindingStatus = \\n  | \'OPEN\' \\n  | \'INVESTIGATING\' \\n  | \'PATCHING\' \\n  | \'MITIGATED\' \\n  | \'FALSE_POSITIVE\' \\n  | \'CLOSED\';\\n\\nexport type FeedType = \\n  | \'RSS_ATOM\' \\n  | \'STIX_2\' \\n  | \'TAXII_21\' \\n  | \'GITHUB_ADVISORY\' \\n  | \'JSON_SEARCH_API\' \\n  | \'NVD_API\' \\n  | \'EPSS_API\' \\n  | \'CISA_KEV\';\\n\\nexport type FeedAuthType = \'NONE\' | \'API_KEY\' | \'BEARER\' | \'BASIC\';\\n\\nexport interface CVSSData {\\n  version: \'3.1\' | \'4.0\' | \'2.0\';\\n  score: number;\\n  vector: string;\\n  severity: Severity;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EPSSData {\\n  score: number;\\n  percentile: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CisaKevData {\\n  isKev: boolean;\\n  dateAdded?: string;\\n  dueDate?: string;\\n  requiredAction?: string;\\n  knownRansomwareCampaignUse?: \'Known\' | \'Unknown\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface RemediationPlaybook {\\n  patchUrl: string;\\n  vendorAdvisoryRef: string;\\n  immediateActions: string[];\\n  workarounds: string[];\\n  rollbackPlan: string;\\n  stepByStep: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface NormalizedCVE {\\n  cveId: string; // Canonical CVE-YYYY-NNNNN\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  publishedDate: string;\\n  modifiedDate: string;\\n  cvss: CVSSData;\\n  cwe: string[];\\n  cpeMatches: string[]; // CPE 2.3 formatted strings\\n  sourceFeeds: string[];\\n  epss: EPSSData;\\n  cisaKev: CisaKevData;\\n  exploitStatus: \'Active Weaponized\' | \'POC Available\' | \'Reported In Wild\' | \'None\';\\n  remediation: RemediationPlaybook;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WatchListItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  vendor: string;\\n  product: string;\\n  cpes: string[]; // Strict CPE 2.3 entries\\n  exposure: ExposureLevel;\\n  assetTag: string;\\n  ownerGroup: string;\\n  active: boolean;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Finding {\\n  id: string;\\n  cveId: string;\\n  cve: NormalizedCVE;\\n  matchedAssetId: string;\\n  matchedAssetName: string;\\n  matchedCpe: string;\\n  exposure: ExposureLevel;\\n  priorityTier: PriorityTier;\\n  slaHours: number;\\n  slaDeadline: string; // ISO string\\n  slaBreached: boolean;\\n  slaPromotedFrom?: PriorityTier;\\n  slaClockResetAt?: string;\\n  status: FindingStatus;\\n  alertedAt: string | null;\\n  reAlertCount: number;\\n  advisoryId: string | null;\\n  assignee?: string;\\n  timeline: {\\n    timestamp: string;\\n    action: string;\\n    user: string;\\n    note: string;\\n  }[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ThreatFeed {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  type: FeedType;\\n  url: string;\\n  authType: FeedAuthType;\\n  authSecretKey?: string; // encrypted/masked at rest\\n  rateLimitPerMin: number;\\n  enabled: boolean;\\n  healthStatus: \'HEALTHY\' | \'DEGRADED\' | \'DOWN\' | \'UNTESTED\';\\n  lastSync: string | null;\\n  latencyMs: number;\\n  vendorSeed: boolean;\\n  itemCountLastRun: number;\\n  errorLog?: string | null;\\n  ssrfValidated: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Advisory {\\n  id: string; // ADV-2026-XXXX\\n  title: string;\\n  severity: Severity;\\n  cveIds: string[];\\n  findingIds: string[];\\n  createdDate: string;\\n  deliveryStatus: \'DELIVERED\' | \'PENDING\' | \'FAILED\' | \'RETRYING\' | \'DRAFT\';\\n  recipientCount: number;\\n  executiveSummary: string;\\n  remediationInstructions: string;\\n  affectedSystems: string[];\\n  slaWarning: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PipelinePhase {\\n  name: string;\\n  status: \'PENDING\' | \'RUNNING\' | \'SUCCESS\' | \'WARNING\' | \'FAILED\';\\n  durationMs: number;\\n  details: string;\\n  metrics?: Record<string, string | number>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PipelineExecution {\\n  id: string;\\n  startTime: string;\\n  endTime: string | null;\\n  status: \'RUNNING\' | \'COMPLETED\' | \'FAILED\' | \'QUARANTINED\';\\n  scopeHours: number;\\n  phases: PipelinePhase[];\\n  stats: {\\n    rawIngested: number;\\n    normalized: number;\\n    deduplicated: number;\\n    inRunDuplicatesDropped: number;\\n    matchedWatchlist: number;\\n    newAlertsGenerated: number;\\n    advisoriesDispatched: number;\\n  };\\n  logs: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AlertedCVE {\\n  cveId: string;\\n  firstAlertedAt: string;\\n  lastAlertedAt: string;\\n  advisoryId: string;\\n  recipientEmails: string[];\\n  status: \'ACTIVE_REMEDIATION\' | \'RESOLVED\' | \'SUPPRESSED\';\\n  reAlertCount: number;\\n  lastReAlertReason?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EmailRecipient {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  role: string;\\n  subscriptionTier: \'ALL_SEVERITIES\' | \'CRITICAL_HIGH_ONLY\' | \'CISA_KEV_ONLY\' | \'WEEKLY_DIGEST\';\\n  enabled: boolean;\\n  deliverySuccessRate: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EmailDeliveryLog {\\n  id: string;\\n  recipientEmail: string;\\n  advisoryId: string;\\n  subject: string;\\n  provider: \'Mailgun\' | \'SMTP_Relay\' | \'Local_Mock\';\\n  status: \'DELIVERED\' | \'BOUNCED\' | \'RETRYING\' | \'FAILED\';\\n  attemptCount: number;\\n  retrySchedule: string[]; // e.g. [\'5m\', \'15m\', \'1h\', \'3h\', \'12h\']\\n  nextRetryTime: string | null;\\n  sentAt: string;\\n  errorMessage?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AuditLog {\\n  id: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  category: \'PIPELINE\' | \'SECURITY\' | \'FEED\' | \'WATCHLIST\' | \'AUTH\' | \'EMAIL\';\\n  level: \'INFO\' | \'WARNING\' | \'ERROR\' | \'CRITICAL\';\\n  event: string;\\n  details: string;\\n  user: string;\\n  ipAddress: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AppSettings {\\n  scopeHours: number; // default 24h\\n  schedulerIntervalMinutes: number; // default 60m\\n  schedulerEnabled: boolean;\\n  advisoryPrefix: string;\\n  ssrfProtection: {\\n    blockPrivateIps: boolean;\\n    blockLoopback: boolean;\\n    allowRedirects: boolean;\\n  };\\n  securityPolicy: {\\n    sessionTimeoutMins: number;\\n    csrfProtection: boolean;\\n    minPasswordLen: number;\\n    maxLoginAttempts: number;\\n    lockoutMins: number;\\n  };\\n  ntpConfig: {\\n    enabled: boolean;\\n    server: string;\\n    driftToleranceMs: number;\\n  };\\n  mailgunConfig: {\\n    enabled: boolean;\\n    apiKey: string;\\n    domain: string;\\n    fromEmail: string;\\n  };\\n  slaTiers: {\\n    cisaKevHours: number;\\n    criticalHours: number;\\n    highHours: number;\\n    mediumHours: number;\\n    lowHours: number;\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create core domain TypeScript interfaces and types\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating types file\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create types file\"}"
