gin: 10px 0 4px 0;\">{{advisory_id}}: {{advisory_title}}</h2>\n      <p style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; margin: 0;\">Dispatched by VulnStream Threat Ingestion Engine on {{dispatch_date}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sla-box\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #c7d2fe;\">Target Remediation SLA:</strong> {{sla_hours}} Hours (Deadline: {{sla_deadline}})<br>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #a5b4fc;\">{{sla_warning}}</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">1. Executive Summary</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6;\">{{executive_summary}}</p>\n\n    <h3 style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">2. Affected Vulnerabilities & Systems</h3>\n    <p><strong>CVE Identifier:</strong> <span class=\"mono\">{{cve_ids}}</span></p>\n    <p><strong>Matched Asset(s):</strong> {{affected_systems}}</p>\n\n    <h3 style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">3. Step-by-Step Remediation Plan</h3>\n    <div style=\"background: #0f172a; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px; color: #38bdf8; font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace; font-size: 13px;\">\n      {{remediation_steps}}\n    </div>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 16px;\"><strong>Vendor Advisory Reference:</strong> <a href=\"{{vendor_link}}\" style=\"color: #38bdf8;\">{{vendor_link}}</a></p>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      Confidential & Proprietary \342\200\224 For Authorized Enterprise Security Distribution Only.<br>\n      To manage alert subscriptions or re-alert on unresolved assets, visit VulnStream SOC Console.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>`;\n"
