  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Elements**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on building the UI components, specifically the views outlined in the user prompt. I\'m starting with the top header and navigation bar. It\'ll feature the \"VulnStream Enterprise\" branding and a high-density cyber emblem. I\'m also planning to implement a real-time SLA breach ticker banner.\n\n\n**Defining Status Indicators**\n\nI\'ve been working on the status indicators for the UI. I\'ve defined indicators for pipeline status, NTP sync, CSRF token, session timeout, and system health. The plan is for these to be visually informative. I\'m also adding a \"Trigger Pipeline Run\" quick action with a scope selector, enabling on-demand runs. Finally, I\'m designing tab navigation to logically organize all the data into groups.\n\n**Designing Dashboard View**\n\nNow I\'m focusing on the dashboard view and defining the executive and SOC KPI stat cards. The goal is for at-a-glance information about findings, including breakdowns, CISA KEV exploitation, SLA status, and monitored assets/exposure. I\'m keen on presenting a very intuitive dashboard.\n\n\n**Developing Watchlist View**\n\nI\'m now completely focused on the \"WatchListView\" component. I\'ve designed the monitored assets table, including columns for asset details, exposure tier, and active toggle. I\'ve also built an interactive CPE 2.3 builder that auto-resolves against the NVD database. Next, I\'m working on the bulk import modal for JSON data, with error feedback.\n\n\n**Implementing Triage Matrix**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the design of the Triage Matrix with advanced filters. I\'ve got Severity, Priority Tier, Exposure, SLA Status, and Text Search all defined. Then, I\'ve moved onto the Findings Table, incorporating critical data like CVE ID, matched asset, exposure, priority tier with escalation indicators, and SLA details. Next is the comprehensive Finding Details Drawer, with full CVSS vector, EPSS, CPE, and SLA clock. I\'m focusing on the status selector now.\n\n\n**Refining Remediation**\n\nI\'m now diving into the remediation playbook associated with each finding, specifically the direct vendor patch URL. I\'m also fleshing out immediate containment actions via a checklist, workarounds, and step-by-step CLI commands with a handy copy button. A rollback plan is also being drafted.\n\nI\'ve also moved to designing a threat data view to include normalized CVE data, and a filterable table. An inspection drawer is being built to show raw JSON records, source feed badges, CWE, and CPE lists. Finally, an advisories view with professional security bulletins and export options is next on the list.\n\n\n**Developing Execution Views**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in developing the ExecutionsView. I\'ve designed a live/historical pipeline runs display with a \"Trigger Manual Run\" button and an hour selector for scope. I\'m focusing on a phase-by-phase breakdown, detailing durations and item throughput for each step: Feed Ingestion & SSRF Check, Normalization, Deduplication & Scope Filtering, Multi-Source Auto-Enrichment, CPE-First Watch-List Matching & SLA Classification, and Advisory Generation & Notification Dispatch. I\'ve also incorporated a JSON report download option.\n\n\n**Defining Feed Controls**\n\nI\'m now focusing on per-feed controls, implementing an enable/disable toggle and a connectivity test. I\'ve also incorporated feed credential editing with robust security measures and a custom threat feed addition modal.\n\\n\\n\n**Developing Recipient Management**\n\nI\'m now concentrating on managing the security distribution lists in the recipients view. This includes implementing an email validation system, and crafting modals for adding, editing, and deleting recipients with options for managing subscription tiers and their related roles.\n\n**Formulating Advisory Templates**\n\nI\'m moving into the development of the AdvisoryTemplateView. I\'m building an editable HTML/Markdown template system with variable tags. I\'m also implementing a live email preview and a test email action with a recipient prompt.\n\n**Tracking Email History**\n\nI\'m developing the EmailHistoryView and tracking the complete delivery logs of all emails sent. I\'m also including provider status checks and retry schedule tracking functionality.\n\n\n**Implementing Operational Logs**\n\nI\'m now focused on the OperationalLogsView. I\'m building a comprehensive, searchable audit trail with filters for Category and Level, and export options as CSV/JSON. I\'m moving on to the SystemHealthView, checking for process and dependency health. I\'m also ensuring readiness with a multi-worker-safe status check, and considering SSRF protection and security header audits. Finally, I\'m working on the SettingsView to allow scope hour customization, using a slider.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_48221"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false,\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { useApp } from \'../context/AppContext\';\\nimport {\\n  ShieldAlert,\\n  Radio,\\n  Clock,\\n  Play,\\n  RotateCw,\\n  Server,\\n  KeyRound,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  AlertTriangle,\\n  Flame,\\n  Activity,\\n  Layers,\\n  ChevronDown,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport const TopHeader: React.FC = () => {\\n  const {\\n    findings,\\n    isPipelineRunning,\\n    currentPipelinePhase,\\n    triggerPipelineRun,\\n    sessionTimeRemainingSec,\\n    resetSessionTimeout,\\n    ntpSyncStatus,\\n    csrfToken,\\n    activeTab,\\n    setActiveTab,\\n  } = useApp();\\n\\n  const [scopeDropdownOpen, setScopeDropdownOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [selectedScope, setSelectedScope] = useState(24);\\n\\n  // Calculate urgency metrics\\n  const breachedCount = findings.filter(f => f.slaBreached && f.status !== \'MITIGATED\' && f.status !== \'CLOSED\').length;\\n  const imminentBreachCount = findings.filter(f => {\\n    if (f.slaBreached || f.status === \'MITIGATED\' || f.status === \'CLOSED\') return false;\\n    const diff = new Date(f.slaDeadline).getTime() - Date.now();\\n    return diff > 0 && diff < 4 * 3600 * 1000;\\n  }).length;\\n  const kevCount = findings.filter(f => f.cve.cisaKev.isKev && f.status !== \'CLOSED\').length;\\n\\n  const sessionMins = Math.floor(sessionTimeRemainingSec / 60);\\n  const sessionSecs = sessionTimeRemainingSec % 60;\\n\\n  const handleRunPipeline = async (hours: number) => {\\n    setSelectedScope(hours);\\n    setScopeDropdownOpen(false);\\n    await triggerPipelineRun(hours);\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-40\\\">\\n      {/* SLA Breach Alert Banner if any breaches exist */}\\n      {(breachedCount > 0 || imminentBreachCount > 0) && (\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-red-950/90 border-b border-red-800/80 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs flex items-center justify-between text-red-200\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"flex h-2 w-2 relative\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-red-400 opacity-75\\\"></span>\\n              <span className=\\\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-red-500\\\"></span>\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <AlertTriangle className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-400\\\" />\\n              SLA Urgency Alert:\\n            </span>\\n            <span>\\n              {breachedCount > 0 && (\\n                <strong className=\\\"text-red-300 font-bold underline mr-2\\\">\\n                  {breachedCount} Finding{breachedCount > 1 ? \'s\' : \'\'} SLA BREACHED!\\n                </strong>\\n              )}\\n              {imminentBreachCount > 0 && (\\n                <span className=\\\"text-amber-300\\\">\\n                  {imminentBreachCount} Finding{imminentBreachCount > 1 ? \'s\' : \'\'} approaching deadline (&lt;4h).\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'findings\')}\\n            className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold bg-red-900/80 hover:bg-red-800 text-white px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-red-700 transition\\\"\\n          >\\n            Review Triage Queue \342\206\222\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Main Top Header Bar */}\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n          {/* Logo & Branding */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2.5 cursor-pointer\\\" onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'dashboard\')}>\\n              <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 via-rose-600 to-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-red-950/50 border border-red-500/30\\\">\\n                <ShieldAlert className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-white\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-mono\\\">\\n                    Vuln<span className=\\\"text-red-500\\\">Stream</span>\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-semibold bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20 px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded tracking-wider uppercase\\\">\\n                    Enterprise\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono tracking-tight\\\">\\n                  Multi-Source Threat Ingestion &amp; SLA Pipeline\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Quick Status Badges */}\\n            <div className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center space-x-2 pl-4 border-l border-slate-800 text-xs\\\">\\n              {/* CISA KEV Badge */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-800/40 px-2 py-1 rounded text-amber-300\\\">\\n                <Flame className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400\\\" />\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono font-medium\\\">{kevCount} CISA KEV</span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Ingestion Status */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-800/40 px-2 py-1 rounded text-emerald-300\\\">\\n                <Radio className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400 animate-pulse\\\" />\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono\\\">19 Feeds Live</span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* NTP Sync */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 px-2 py-1 rounded text-slate-400\\\">\\n                <Clock className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px]\\\">NTP: \302\261{ntpSyncStatus.driftMs}ms</span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Right Action Tools & Profile */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n            {/* Session Timeout Monitor */}\\n            <div\\n              onClick={resetSessionTimeout}\\n              title=\\\"Click to refresh 30-min session security token\\\"\\n              className=\\\"hidden sm:flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded cursor-pointer text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 transition\\\"\\n            >\\n              <KeyRound className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-indigo-400\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono\\\">\\n                {String(sessionMins).padStart(2, \'0\')}:{String(sessionSecs).padStart(2, \'0\')}\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase\\\">Lax</span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Manual Run Pipeline Button with Scope selector */}\\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex rounded-md shadow-sm\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => handleRunPipeline(selectedScope)}\\n                  disabled={isPipelineRunning}\\n                  className={`inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-l-md border transition ${\\n                    isPipelineRunning\\n                      ? \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border-slate-700 cursor-not-allowed\'\\n                      : \'bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white border-red-500 shadow-md shadow-red-950/40\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  {isPipelineRunning ? (\\n                    <>\\n                      <RotateCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-spin\\\" />\\n                      <span>Ingesting...</span>\\n                    </>\\n                  ) : (\\n                    <>\\n                      <Play className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current\\\" />\\n                      <span>Run Pipeline ({selectedScope}h)</span>\\n                    </>\\n                  )}\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => setScopeDropdownOpen(prev => !prev)}\\n                  disabled={isPipelineRunning}\\n                  className=\\\"bg-red-700 hover:bg-red-600 text-white border-l border-red-500 px-2 rounded-r-md text-xs flex items-center justify-center transition\\\"\\n                  title=\\\"Change Scope Window\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {scopeDropdownOpen && (\\n                <div className=\\\"absolute right-0 mt-2 w-48 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-md shadow-xl py-1 z-50 text-xs\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-800 uppercase\\\">\\n                    Timeline Scope Window\\n                  </div>\\n                  {[6, 12, 24, 48, 72, 168].map(hrs => (\\n                    <button\\n                      key={hrs}\\n                      onClick={() => handleRunPipeline(hrs)}\\n                      className={`w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between ${\\n                        selectedScope === hrs ? \'text-red-400 font-bold bg-slate-800/50\' : \'text-slate-300\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      <span>Past {hrs} Hours</span>\\n                      {selectedScope === hrs && <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-400\\\" />}\\n                    </button>\\n                  ))}\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* System Health Status link */}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'health\')}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-xs bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 text-emerald-400 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded transition\\\"\\n              title=\\\"System Health Checks (/live, /health, /ready)\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Activity className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"hidden md:inline font-mono\\\">SOC Ready</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Live Phase Progress Ticker during pipeline execution */}\\n        {isPipelineRunning && (\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-indigo-300 bg-indigo-950/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded border border-indigo-900/40\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n              <RotateCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-spin text-indigo-400\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono font-medium\\\">{currentPipelinePhase}</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-indigo-400 font-mono\\\">Autonomous APScheduler Engine</span>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Primary Sub-Navigation Bar */}\\n      <div className=\\\"border-t border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-950/60 overflow-x-auto\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex space-x-1 py-1\\\">\\n          {[\\n            { id: \'dashboard\', label: \'Dashboard\', icon: Layers },\\n            { id: \'watchlist\', label: \'Watch List\', count: 8 },\\n            { id: \'findings\', label: \'Findings\', count: findings.filter(f => f.status !== \'CLOSED\').length, badgeColor: breachedCount > 0 ? \'bg-red-500 text-white\' : undefined },\\n            { id: \'threat-data\', label: \'Threat Data\' },\\n            { id: \'advisories\', label: \'Advisories\' },\\n            { id: \'pipeline\', label: \'Pipeline Executions\' },\\n            { id: \'alerted-cves\', label: \'Alerted CVEs\' },\\n            { id: \'feeds\', label: \'Threat Feeds\', count: 19 },\\n            { id: \'recipients\', label: \'Recipients\' },\\n            { id: \'template\', label: \'Advisory Template\' },\\n            { id: \'emails\', label: \'Email History\' },\\n            { id: \'logs\', label: \'Operational Logs\' },\\n            { id: \'health\', label: \'System Health\' },\\n            { id: \'settings\', label: \'Settings\' },\\n          ].map(tab => {\\n            const isActive = activeTab === tab.id;\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={tab.id}\\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(tab.id)}\\n                className={`whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-xs font-medium transition flex items-center space-x-1.5 ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? \'bg-slate-800 text-white font-semibold shadow-inner border border-slate-700/60\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-900\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <span>{tab.label}</span>\\n                {tab.count !== undefined && (\\n                  <span\\n                    className={`text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded-full font-mono ${\\n                      tab.badgeColor || (isActive ? \'bg-slate-700 text-slate-200\' : \'bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-400\')\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {tab.count}\\n                  </span>\\n                )}\\n              </button>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Implement TopHeader with SLA urgency alerts, pipeline triggers, scope selector, session countdown, and SOC sub-nav tabs\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/TopHeader.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating TopHeader.tsx\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create top navigation header\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
