ile. I\'ve applied the NextUI Card design with a dark theme and rounded corners. My next step is removing the SLA metrics and replacing them with new components.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"Append\":\"false\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\nimport { useApp } from \'../context/AppContext\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  Shield,\\\\n  Flame,\\\\n  Radio,\\\\n  FileText,\\\\n  Server,\\\\n  ArrowUpRight,\\\\n  TrendingUp,\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  ExternalLink,\\\\n  Zap,\\\\n  Cpu,\\\\n  MailCheck,\\\\n  Send,\\\\n} from \'\\n<truncated 17226 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update DashboardView to NextUI styling, removing all SLA widgets and focusing on autonomous product tracking and auto-dispatch\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating DashboardView\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update DashboardView to NextUI style without SLA\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":82,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:04:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":5441,\"cache_read_tokens\":181829,\"output_tokens\":6726,\"thinking\":\"**Refining Visual Presentation**\\n\\nI\'m currently updating `FindingsView.tsx`. The interface is receiving a NextUI styling overhaul. I\'m aiming for clean, rounded cards with subtle borders, chip badges, and smooth inputs. The focus is now on product vulnerability tracking by removing all SLA-related information like columns, timers, badges, resets, and filters.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"Append\":\"false\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { useApp } from \'../context/AppContext\';\\\\nimport { Finding, FindingStatus, ExposureLevel } from \'../types\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  Shield,\\\\n  Flame,\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  ExternalLink,\\\\n  ChevronRight,\\\\n  Filter,\\\\n  