  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the UI Redesign**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the request. My initial focus is the UI redesign, specifically the menu transition. The goal is a left-side panel with SVG icons, shifting from the existing horizontal top bar. I\'m noting the structural change and the specific requirement for SVG icons. This is the core requirement that I am working with now.\n\n\n**Refining the Sidebar Design**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the sidebar implementation, with Lucide-react icons in mind. I\'m focusing on a clean, structured layout that\'s collapsible, aiming for a high-quality enterprise feel. The design must accommodate items with counts, like \"Monitored Products\" and \"Vulnerabilities\". The top header will need to include the app logo, search, quick stats, and light/dark mode toggles, pipeline trigger, and session timer.\n\n\n**Updating the Preview Process**\n\nI\'m now shifting gears to the \"HTML Template\" concept, renaming it from \"Rendered Client Preview\". My focus is enabling direct edits within the preview. I envision real-time manipulation of font styles, colors, and backgrounds, alongside the ability to add annotations and drawing objects. The key is that these changes should be immediately rendered and applied to all new notifications, saving updated template styles for future use.\n\n\n**Expanding the CVE Scope**\n\nI\'m now expanding the focus to include CVE matching, ensuring it accounts for both published and modified CVEs within the defined scope. I\'m building out a robust matching logic to incorporate these dynamic updates, especially those where NVD updates CVSS or CISA adds existing CVEs to its KEV list.\n\n\n**Implementing Dashboard Navigation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on clickable dashboard cards. My plan is to link each KPI card to a specific section: \"Monitored Products\" to \'watchlist\', \"Active Vulnerabilities\" to \'findings\', and so on. Exposure breakdown items will filter the \'watchlist\', and correlated product vulnerability items will open a vulnerability playbook drawer. I need to make sure the navigation to specific sections or filtered views function as expected.\n\n\n\n"
