active playground, envisioning preset loaders for common scenarios and the inputs needed for matching. I\'m thinking about fields like vendor, product, version, architecture, and platform, along with an optional PURL input and CSAF VEX status. I\'m also planning a \\\"Run Matching Engine Evaluation\\\" button and real-time output.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WatchListView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking WatchListView imports\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WatchListView imports\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":187,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:23:18Z\",\"input_tokens\":3786,\"cache_read_tokens\":91726,\"output_tokens\":190,\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Integration**\\n\\nI\'m checking the integration of `matchesWatchlistItem` and `cveData` from `useApp()` into `WatchListView.tsx`. It appears `cveData: NormalizedCVE[]` is already accessible through `AppContextType`. I will continue to verify this within the simulator.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WatchListView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"613\",\"StartLine\":\"500\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking bottom of WatchListView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View end of WatchListView\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":189,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:23:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":2200,\"cache_read_tokens\":95502,\"output_tokens\":13980,\"thinking\":\"**Adding PURLs and Architectures**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the `WatchListView.tsx` component. My primary objective is to incorporate PURL input fields and target architecture selections into the Add/Edit Product form. This will enable users to register precise PURLs, like `pkg:maven/org.apache.logging.log4j/log4j-core@2.14.1`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"n