:\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:25:51Z\",\"input_tokens\":14145,\"cache_read_tokens\":111642,\"output_tokens\":325,\"thinking\":\"**Examining RecipientsView**\\n\\nOkay, I\'ve got `WatchListView.tsx` completed. Now, I\'m shifting focus to `RecipientsView.tsx`. The goal is to integrate support for Autonomous Webhook Channels, including Slack, Teams, and SOAR HMAC alongside existing Email Distribution lists. I\'m taking a close look at the current structure of `src/components/RecipientsView.tsx` to understand the existing setup.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/context/AppContext.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"140\",\"StartLine\":\"70\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking AppContext webhooks\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View AppContext webhooks\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":195,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:25:58Z\",\"input_tokens\":3876,\"cache_read_tokens\":123727,\"output_tokens\":102,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/data/seedData.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"620\",\"StartLine\":\"570\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking webhooks in seedData.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View webhooks in seedData\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":197,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:26:02Z\",\"input_tokens\":3293,\"cache_read_tokens\":125465,\"output_tokens\":217,\"thinking\":\"**Exposing Webhooks in App**\\n\\nI\'ve made progress! I\'ve confirmed `INITIAL_WEBHOOKS` and `INITIAL_WEBHOOK_LOGS` are set up in `seedData.ts`. The next step is to expose these webhooks within `AppContext.tsx`. I intend to include `webhooks: WebhookEndpoint[]`, `webhookLogs: WebhookDeliveryLog[]`, and `addWebhook: (endpoint) => void` within `AppContext.tsx`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/context/AppConte