ng Audit Log Generation**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on how audit logs are generated within `AppContext.tsx`. Specifically, I\'m examining the data used to create the hash: the timestamp, the previous hash, the category, the event, and the details. I\'m taking a close look at how these elements are combined. I\'m focusing on the `quickHash` function and ensuring that this process will be robust and secure.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/context/AppContext.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"660\",\"StartLine\":\"630\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing latestExecution in AppContext\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View latestExecution export\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":251,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:28:49Z\",\"input_tokens\":2887,\"cache_read_tokens\":171426,\"output_tokens\":96,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/context/AppContext.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"580\",\"StartLine\":\"550\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking where latestExecution is defined\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View latestExecution definition\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":253,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:28:52Z\",\"input_tokens\":2872,\"cache_read_tokens\":172191,\"output_tokens\":307,\"thinking\":\"**Fixing a Critical Bug**\\n\\nI\'ve identified a critical bug! The `latestExecution` variable was accidentally overwritten during the webhook method addition. I\'ve corrected this by defining `const latestExecution` using `useMemo` right above the `value = {` assignment. Additionally, in `src/engine/pipelineEngine.ts`, I\'ve fixed an issue on line 94 regarding `AuditLog`. I\'m confident this resolves the issue.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/engine/pipelineEngine.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"110\",\"StartLine\":\"85\",\"toolAction\":