":\"\\\"Create sleek enterprise Sidebar component with clean SVG icons, categorized sections, badge counts, light/dark mode toggle, and session monitor\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/Sidebar.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Sidebar.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Sidebar component\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":323,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:33:21Z\",\"input_tokens\":3320,\"cache_read_tokens\":214200,\"output_tokens\":242,\"thinking\":\"**Refining TopHeader\'s Role**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m thinking about `TopHeader.tsx`. Since the menu is now on the left, this component\'s new job is clear: it\'s a sleek application bar. I envision it showing the active section\'s title, like \\\"Vulnerabilities Tracker,\\\" nice and clean.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/TopHeader.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing TopHeader.tsx top\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View TopHeader.tsx top\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":325,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:33:36Z\",\"input_tokens\":3350,\"cache_read_tokens\":215448,\"output_tokens\":3097,\"thinking\":\"**Designing the Header**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m working on the design for `TopHeader.tsx`. I\'ve outlined the core functionalities; it\'ll display the current tab\'s title and breadcrumb. I\'m also planning quick status pills for various data points. The goal is a clean, informative header.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"Append\":\"false\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { useApp } from \'../context/AppContext\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  RotateCw,\\\\n  Play,\\\\n  ChevronDown,\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  Clock,\\\\n  Radio,\\\\n  Cpu,\\\\n  Sun,\\\\n  Moon,\\\\n  Search,\\\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\\\n\\\\nconst TAB_TITLES:\\n<truncated 8993 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update TopHeader to be a clean enterprise topbar with breadcrumb titles, status chips, light/dark mode icon toggle, and scope pipeline run button\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/TopHeader.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating TopHeader.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update TopHeader component\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":327,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:33:58Z\",\"input_tokens\":3304,\"cache_read_tokens\":218772,\"output_tokens\":189,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing App Layout**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on structuring `src/App.tsx`. I envision a flex row for the main layout. On the left, a fixed `<Sidebar />` component will hold its position or be full height, with a width of 64. The right side will take the remaining space as a flex-grow element.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing App.tsx layout\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View App.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":329,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:34:04Z\",\"input_tokens\":3686,\"cache_read_tokens\":219997,\"output_tokens\":1360,\"thinking\":\"**Revising App Component**\\n\\nI\'m currently structuring the `App.tsx` file. I\'m incorporating a `<Sidebar />` on the left side. The main content will encompass `<TopHeader />`, `<MainContent />`, and `<Footer />`. I\'m also planning theme wrapper classes for dark and light modes.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"Append\":\"false\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\nimport { AppProvider, useApp } from \'./context/AppContext\';\\\\nimport { Sidebar } from \'./components/Sidebar\';\\\\nimport { TopHeader } from \'./components/TopHeader\';\\\\nimport { DashboardView } from \'./components/DashboardView\';\\\\nimp\\n<truncated 3736 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update App.tsx to use left sidebar layout, AppShell with theme support, clean topbar, and main content area\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating App.tsx layout\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update App.tsx for left sidebar\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":331,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:34:14Z\",\"input_tokens\":3623,\"cache_read_tokens\":221601,\"output_tokens\":10026,\"thinking\":\"**Refactoring Component Display**\\n\\nI\'m removing the HTML Email Template box from `src/components/AdvisoryTemplateView.tsx`. The goal is to allow changes directly within the Rendered Client Preview. I\'m focusing on implementing options there for users to change aspects of the preview without needing an external editor. This aims to streamline the editing process.\\n\\n\\n**Designing Template Editor**\\n\\nI\'m now focused on the design of `AdvisoryTemplateView.tsx`. I\'ve outlined a layout with a header featuring the na\\n<truncated 459 bytes>\\nd HTML template and will apply to all new notifications.\\n\\n\\n**Adding Color and Stamps**\\n\\nI\'m now integrating color pickers for heading text, with quick swatches available. I\'m also adding swatches for accent and link colors. Furthermore, I\'ve defined background color options for the canvas, cards, and header banners to give users more customization options. I\'m adding options for a security stamp or watermark badge and providing preset stamps, along with a custom stamp input field and color customization.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"Append\":\"false\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { useApp } from \'../context/AppContext\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  FileCode,\\\\n  Send,\\\\n  RotateCcw,\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  AlertCircle,\\\\n  Copy,\\\\n  Check,\\\\n  X,\\\\n  Type,\\\\n  Palette,\\\\n  Stamp,\\\\n  Sliders,\\\\n  Smartphone,\\\\n  \\n<truncated 32028 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Rewrite AdvisoryTemplateView to remove raw HTML box, allow changes directly on preview with font color/style, background colors, and drawing objects/stamps, and rename to HTML template\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/AdvisoryTemplateView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Writing AdvisoryTemplateView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update AdvisoryTemplateView\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":333,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:35:12Z\",\"input_tokens\":10416,\"cache_read_tokens\":225249,\"output_tokens\":530,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Dashboard Components**\\n\\nI\'m currently reviewing `DashboardView.tsx`. The goal is to implement clickable cards in the dashboard. I\'ve noted the existing \\\"Monitored Products\\\" hero card. Next, I need to figure out how to integrate CVE matching based on both published and last modified dates within this view.\\n\\n\\n**Defining Dashboard Navigation**\\n\\nI\'ve been mapping out the navigation for the dashboard\'s KPI and Exposure Breakdown cards. Each card\'s click action is now linked to a specific route, such as \'watchlist\', \'findings\', \'emails\', \'feeds\', or \'advisories\'. This includes the \\\"Monitored Products\\\" card which now navigates to the \'watchlist\' route. My next task involves determining how these navigation elements will be represented within the UI and how data will be passed to the underlying components.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"100\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing DashboardView.tsx imports and start\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View DashboardView top\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":335,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:35:22Z\",\"input_tokens\":2354,\"cache_read_tokens\":235769,\"output_tokens\":8663,\"thinking\":\"**Implementing Clickable KPIs**\\n\\nI\'m currently working on making the KPI cards in `DashboardView.tsx` clickable. My plan is to add an `onClick` handler to the \\\"Monitored Products\\\" card that will switch the active tab to \\\"watchlist.\\\" I\'ll also add a `cursor-pointer`, a `group` class, hover effects, and an arrow indicator to make it visually clear that the card is interactive.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"Append\":\"false\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\nimport { useApp } from \'../context/AppContext\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  Shield,\\\\n  Flame,\\\\n  Radio,\\\\n  FileText,\\\\n  Server,\\\\n  ArrowUpRight,\\\\n  Zap,\\\\n  Cpu,\\\\n  MailCheck,\\\\n  Send,\\\\n  ExternalLink,\\\\n  Layers,\\\\n  ChevronRight,\\\\n  Database,\\\\\\n<truncated 27075 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update DashboardView with clickable KPI cards, exposure bars, and clickable pipeline steps with direct navigation\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Make DashboardView cards clickable\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":337,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:36:10Z\",\"input_tokens\":9014,\"cache_read_tokens\":237977,\"output_tokens\":200,\"thinking\":\"**Implementing Pagination Updates**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on integrating pagination across multiple views. I\'m starting with `FindingsView.tsx`, `WatchListView.tsx`, `ThreatDataView.tsx`, and `EmailHistoryView.tsx`. My goal is to streamline the display of large datasets in each table for improved user experience.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"70\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking FindingsView.tsx top\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View FindingsView top\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":339,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:36:15Z\",\"input_tokens\":3357,\"cache_read_tokens\":244915,\"output_tokens\":147,\"thinking\":\"**Implementing Pagination Controls**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m integrating pagination controls into `FindingsView.tsx`. I\'ve added `currentPage` and `pageSize` state. Next, I\'ll import the `Pagination` component. I\'m slicing `filteredFindings` based on the current page and page size, and then I\'ll render the `<Pagination />` component.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"290\",\"StartLine\":\"255\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing end of table in FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View FindingsView table bottom\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":341,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:36:22Z\",\"input_tokens\":3044,\"cache_read_tokens\":246211,\"output_tokens\":595,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Import Pagination and add pagination state in FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"45\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Import Pagination and add currentPage, pageSize states\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"import {\\\\n  Shield,\\\\n  Flame,\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  ExternalLink,\\\\n  ChevronRight,\\\\n  Filter,\\\\n  Search,\\\\n  RotateCcw,\\\\n  Terminal,\\\\n  FileCheck,\\\\n  Copy,\\\\n  Check,\\\\n  X,\\\\n  Send,\\\\n  Cpu,\\\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { Pagination } from \'./Pagination\';\\\\n\\n<truncated 605 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"3\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"import {\\\\n  Shield,\\\\n  Flame,\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  ExternalLink,\\\\n  ChevronRight,\\\\n  Filter,\\\\n  Search,\\\\n  RotateCcw,\\\\n  Terminal,\\\\n  FileCheck,\\\\n  Copy,\\\\n  Check,\\\\n  X,\\\\n  Send,\\\\n  Cpu,\\\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\\\n\\\\nexport const FindingsView: React.FC = () =\\n<truncated 456 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding Pagination to FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add pagination state in FindingsView\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":343,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:36:30Z\",\"input_tokens\":3120,\"cache_read_tokens\":247116,\"output_tokens\":126,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"220\",\"StartLine\":\"190\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking table map in FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View table map in FindingsView\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":345,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:36:38Z\",\"input_tokens\":2925,\"cache_read_tokens\":248102,\"output_tokens\":87,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"295\",\"StartLine\":\"275\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking end of table in FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View end of table in FindingsView\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":347,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:36:43Z\",\"input_tokens\":2714,\"cache_read_tokens\":248899,\"output_tokens\":2213,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Paginate findings list and render Pagination in FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"287\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Paginate findings table and include Pagination component at bottom\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"                  {paginatedFindings.length === 0 ? (\\\\n                    <tr>\\\\n                      <td colSpan={6} className=\\\\\\\"py-8 text-center text-zinc-500 text-xs\\\\\\\">\\\\n                        No product vulnerabilities match the current filter.\\\\n   \\n<truncated 4924 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"194\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"                  {filteredFindings.length === 0 ? (\\\\n                    <tr>\\\\n                      <td colSpan={6} className=\\\\\\\"py-8 text-center text-zinc-500 text-xs\\\\\\\">\\\\n                        No product vulnerabilities match the current filter.\\\\n    \\n<truncated 4541 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding Pagination to FindingsView table\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Render Pagination in FindingsView\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":349,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:36:58Z\",\"input_tokens\":2786,\"cache_read_tokens\":251534,\"output_tokens\":109,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"75\",\"StartLine\":\"60\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking filteredFindings in FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View filteredFindings lines\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":351,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:37:03Z\",\"input_tokens\":2627,\"cache_read_tokens\":252195,\"output_tokens\":206,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Define paginatedFindings in FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"66\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add paginatedFindings slice calculation\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"    return matchesSearch && matchesSeverity && matchesExposure && matchesStatus;\\\\n  });\\\\n\\\\n  const paginatedFindings = filteredFindings.slice(\\\\n    (currentPage - 1) * pageSize,\\\\n    currentPage * pageSize\\\\n  );\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"63\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"    return matchesSearch && matchesSeverity && matchesExposure && matchesStatus;\\\\n  });\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Defining paginatedFindings in FindingsView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Define paginatedFindings\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":353,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T07:37:06Z\",\"input_tokens\":2620,\"cache_read_tokens\":252697,\"output_tokens\":105,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WatchListView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"80\",\"StartLine\":\"50\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking filteredAssets in WatchListView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View filteredAssets lines\\\"\"}}]}"
